<section class="conversion revenue-proof" id="reviews">
  <div class="revenue-proof-copy">
    <h2>Useful pet care finds, bundled for everyday routines</h2>
    <p>Popular picks are grouped around the jobs shoppers already need done: cleaner paws, easier walks, healthier teeth, calmer grooming, and better travel days.</p>
    <div class="proof-stats" aria-label="Store confidence signals">
      <span><strong>4.9/5</strong> Average product rating</span>
      <span><strong>150+</strong> UK review mentions</span>
      <span><strong>FREE</strong> UK delivery on every order</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="testimonial-grid" aria-label="Customer testimonials">
    <figure>
      <div class="commerce-rating">★★★★★ <span>Verified buyer</span></div>
      <blockquote>The paw washer and towel bundle made muddy walks much easier. I added the brush after seeing it paired with the cleaner.</blockquote>
      <figcaption>Sarah M. · Dog owner</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <div class="commerce-rating">★★★★★ <span>Repeat buyer</span></div>
      <blockquote>The product pages made it clear what went together. I bought the bottle, bowl, and travel add-on in one order.</blockquote>
      <figcaption>James R. · Weekend walker</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <div class="commerce-rating">★★★★★ <span>Grooming routine</span></div>
      <blockquote>I liked that checkout did not surprise me. Shipping and returns were clear before I added everything to basket.</blockquote>
      <figcaption>Priya K. · Cat and dog household</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

